    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>17</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "400",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>17</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>21</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>19</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Now on subtracting above equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>19</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>20</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
